                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Marshall to
                        Brigadier General Henry A. Byroade, at
                        Peiping</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-05-26">26 May 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>775. Be prepared to move advance section of your Headquarters to Changchun
                    immediately on receiving clearance from me, and notice that field at Changchun
                    can safely receive planes.</p>
            </div>
